  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "9QWynLIlpnjNOR4qlyTK+3Oz6Xo=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:29:28.456Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "Agitavit Solutions is a small Slovenian firm whose only recorded stack is its own eHRM product, and the assessment describes the evidence as thin. Owning a product is normally the signal that counts against a lead in this set, because a firm's own application occupies the layer a partnership would need.\n\nThe honest position here is not a judgement, though \u2014 it is an absence. Nothing in the record says whether the eHRM product is the whole business or one line among several. The lead sits at priority 4, needs OSS screen, which is the right place for an entry whose file contains a product name and a size adjective.\n\n---\n\n## Leads sharing this finding (1)\n\n**4 \u00b7 needs OSS screen**\n- Agitavit Solutions (SI)\n\nVerbatim research text this claim was extracted from:\n\n> Small, thin evidence.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-19T11:29:28.456721Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:29:28.456726Z"
    }
  },
